window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Minds break and hearts shatter, and someone thinks it doesn't matter…</b></p> <p>When the bodies of middle-aged men begin turning up around Tacoma, the case is quickly turned over to the FBI. Ominous graves marked with cryptic shrines indicate a deeper meaning to the crimes. Are the bodies sacrifices, messages, or something else entirely?</p> <p>Still reeling from a fresh revelation about someone in her past, Special Agent Allie Bishop is sent on a whirlwind ride through her city's underbelly, going deep into dark, hidden worlds full of greed and corruption.</p> <p>And what she'll find is a killer unlike any she's ever seen.</p> <p><i>Don't miss this thrilling installment in the celebrated Allie Bishop FBI Mystery Thriller series!</i></p>"; 
